OL,3,GNEWSAWorker paralysed in 30ft fall from
OL,4,Apylon gets #10m payout
OL,5,
OL,6,FPugh, who was 33 at the time, sued his
OL,7,Femployer, Wood Transmission and
OL,8,FDistribution Ltd, after the Health and
OL,9,FSafety Executive (HSE) found "adequate
OL,10,Fsafety arrangements" had not been in
OL,11,Fplace.
